// SEED-8: JourneyEvent — USES audit.events via entity_type='journey_event'
// NOT a separate table; routes to audit.events (no_direct_write RLS = append-only by policy).
// Decision ratified B3.3 S085: audit.events HAS no_direct_write RLS; AuditEvent trigger commented out.
// Wire: entity_type discriminator = 'journey_event'; journeyId + pegId in payload Json.
// After db-push (2026-06-27): add entity_type='journey_event' rows to audit.events.
// Payload schema:
//   { journeyId, pegId, actorId, actorTier: PersonaTier, transition: 'advance'|'skip'|'block',
//     evidence_hash, policy_version, risk_class: RiskClass, gate_result: PolicyResult,
//     blocking_reason?, override_justification? }
// No separate model — see libs/policies/audit-triggers.sql audit.events + B3.3 decision.

